{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f4b9a52-1c3e-4d7a-9b2f-0a7c5e8d1f21",
    "name": "OficioYa Service - Solicitudes",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar los endpoints del servicio de solicitudes de OficioYa.\n\n## Preparacion\n1. Importar esta coleccion y el environment `OficioYa Local`.\n2. Levantar el servicio en `http://localhost:8081` con el perfil `dev`.\n3. Ejecutar **Auth > Login (CONTRATANTE)**: el test guarda el token en `{{token}}`.\n4. Para aceptar o rechazar solicitudes se necesita un token con rol TRABAJADOR. Generarlo con:\n\n```powershell\n.\\postman\\generate-dev-tokens.ps1\n```\n\nCopiar el valor `TRABAJADOR=...` en la variable de entorno `workerToken`.\n\n## Nota\nEl login actual es de laboratorio: ignora las credenciales y siempre emite un token CONTRATANTE. Por eso `workerToken` se genera aparte con el mismo secreto de desarrollo.\\n\\nPara aceptar o rechazar una solicitud existente, generar el token con el UUID que ya esta en la base de datos: `generate-dev-tokens.ps1 -Role TRABAJADOR -UserId <uuid>`. Si se usa un UUID aleatorio, la accion devuelve 404.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (CONTRATANTE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('contractorToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('Token CONTRATANTE guardado en la variable token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"usuario@oficioya.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secreto\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Solicitudes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar mis solicitudes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(data) && data.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('requestId', data[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('requestId guardado: ' + data[0].id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('No hay solicitudes para este usuario');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Aceptar solicitud (TRABAJADOR)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta controlada (200, 403, 404 o 409)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 403, 404, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{workerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/accept",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{requestId}}",
                "accept"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rechazar solicitud (TRABAJADOR)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta controlada (200, 403, 404 o 409)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 403, 404, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{workerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/reject",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{requestId}}",
                "reject"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Resolver conflicto (CONTRATANTE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta controlada (200, 403, 404 o 409)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 403, 404, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/accept-conflict",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
